# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"NOTICE: IBM leverages the services of Credly, a third-party data processor "
"authorized by IBM and located in the United States, to assist in the "
"administration of the IBM Digital Badge program. In order to issue you an "
"IBM Digital Badge, your personal information (name, email address, and badge"
" earned) will be shared with Credly. You will receive an email notification "
"from Credly with instructions for claiming the badge. Your personal "
"information is used to issue your badge and for program reporting and "
"operational purposes. IBM may share the personal information collected with "
"IBM subsidiaries and third parties globally. It will be handled in a manner "
"consistent with IBM privacy practices. The IBM Privacy Statement can be "
"viewed [here.](https://www.ibm.com/privacy/us/en/)\n"
msgstr ""
"NOTIS: IBM menggunakan perkhidmatan Credly, pemproses data pihak ketiga yang"
" diberi kuasa oleh IBM dan berlokasi di Amerika Syarikat, untuk membantu "
"dalam pentadbiran program IBM Digital Badge. Bagi mengeluarkan IBM Digital "
"Badge kepada anda, maklumat peribadi anda (nama, alamat e-mel, dan lencana "
"yang diperoleh) akan dikongsi dengan Credly. Anda akan menerima "
"pemberitahuan e-mel daripada Credly dengan arahan untuk menuntut lencana "
"tersebut. Maklumat peribadi anda digunakan untuk mengeluarkan lencana dan "
"untuk tujuan pelaporan program serta operasi. IBM mungkin berkongsi maklumat"
" peribadi yang dikumpul dengan anak syarikat IBM dan pihak ketiga di seluruh"
" dunia. Ia akan dikendalikan secara konsisten dengan amalan privasi IBM. "
"Penyataan Privasi IBM boleh dilihat [di "
"sini.](https://www.ibm.com/privacy/us/en/)\n"
